WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.042
For decades, NASA has screened spacecraft materials

00:00:03.042 --> 00:00:06.000
with an upward flame test on Earth.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.708
In lunar-gravity tests, some materials burned in less oxygen.

00:00:09.708 --> 00:00:13.000
Yet our flight archive contains no lunar burns.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.583
FIRST FIRE maps 1,622 NASA source rows,

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:19.167
checks quotations against their sources,

00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:22.000
and lets you test a rover cabin.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.958
NASA plans four fabric burns on the Moon.

00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:30.000
We signed our forecast. The results will show how it scored.

